title: The Generals Hold Berlin
subtitle: The strike has broken, and the putsch has not.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_kapp = 1 and crisis_time = 2 and kapp_decided = 0 and strike_count <= 2 and e20_kapp_army = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 5
on-arrival: {!
Q.kapp_decided = 1;
Q.kapp_outcome = 2;
Q.government_name = 'Military dictatorship (Kapp, Lüttwitz)';
Q.chancellor = 'Wolfgang Kapp';
for (var p of Q.parties) { Q[p + '_in_government'] = 0; }
Q.dnvp_in_government = 1;
Q.stability -= 20;
Q.army_loyalty -= 20;
Q.freikorps_strength += 40;
Q.spd_relation += 10;
for (var d of Q.districts) { if (d != 'ruhr') { RG.endStrike(d, 'crushed'); } }
RG.districtSync();
RG.district('berlin', {repression: 25});
RG.news('The strike breaks: the generals hold Berlin', 3);
!}

= The Generals Hold Berlin

The strike did not hold. On the fifth day the railwaymen of Brandenburg drifted back to work under the guns of the Ehrhardt Brigade, and the Reichswehr, which had waited to see who would win, decided. Kapp stays in the Chancellery. Lüttwitz rules Prussia under martial law. The courts-martial have begun, and the lists of our functionaries are in the hands of the military police.

Only the Ruhr still fights. Its armed workers hold the coalfield.

- @underground: Take the party underground, and wait.
- @fortress: Put everything we have into the Ruhr.

@underground
subtitle: The party survives as a conspiracy.
on-arrival: {!
Q.ending_id = 3;
Q.crisis = 0;
Q.crisis_kapp = 0;
Q.crisis_ruhr = 0;
Q.crisis_name = 0;
Q.crisis_goal = 0;
Q.crisis_line_1 = 0;
Q.crisis_line_2 = 0;
Q.crisis_line_3 = 0;
Q.ruhr_red_army = 1;
!}

The couriers carry the last instructions: bury the presses, burn the membership lists, trust no one. Without Berlin, the Ruhr Red Army is crushed within a fortnight.

- @end: See how it ends.

@fortress
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] If the Ruhr holds, the dictatorship may yet crack.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids an armed rising.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_uprising == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.lean_offensive += 3;
Q.e20_ruhr_extra = 10;
!}
go-to: e20_kapp_falls.ruhr

@end
go-to: game_over
